Prior hidden-state probing targets standard LLMs~\citep{zhou2024alignment,arditi2024refusal}; prior reasoning safety work remains at the text level~\citep{harmthoughts,safethink}. The intersection---hidden-state monitoring of reasoning model safety trajectories---is unexplored, and existing hidden-state analyses operate across layers (spatial) rather than across generation steps (temporal). \cref{fig:concept_overview} illustrates this metric-induced reversal.\looseness=-1

\begin{figure*}[t]
